WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.362
Experiments use a controlled synthetic setup that
matches the theory.

00:00:04.442 --> 00:00:09.125
There are six in-domain relevant patterns and
twenty-four irrelevant ones,

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:13.180
and tasks are binary classifications built from
these patterns.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.008
Two models are trained: the one-layer Transformer
that the theory analyzes,

00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:21.935
and a small real-world GPT-2 with three layers and
two heads.

00:00:22.015 --> 00:00:27.793
Training uses a context length of twenty and a
relevant-pattern fraction of eighty percent,

00:00:27.873 --> 00:00:35.324
and out-of-domain evaluation uses new tasks whose
relevant patterns are linear combinations of the training patterns,

00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:37.770
exactly the regime the theorems cover.
